WEBVTT

01:24.960 --> 01:27.240
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:34.720 --> 01:36.280
We haven't seen each other

01:36.360 --> 01:38.000
since we parted from Guangzhou.

01:38.080 --> 01:40.280
Now, we both

01:40.360 --> 01:42.880
work for Prince Ying.

01:43.520 --> 01:46.560
We have to work in unison.

01:46.640 --> 01:47.880
Nanying, that's not true.

01:48.720 --> 01:49.920
I work for our country.

01:50.000 --> 01:51.800
Prince Ying and I are friends.

01:51.880 --> 01:53.600
I can't mix business with private matters.

01:55.560 --> 01:56.400
Speaking of that,

01:57.000 --> 01:59.040
I want to congratulate you
on your promotion.

02:00.400 --> 02:03.200
Over the years,

02:03.280 --> 02:04.640
I have taken care
of Prince Tan's hidden assets.

02:05.320 --> 02:07.000
Prince Ying,
I'd like to give it all to you.

02:07.080 --> 02:12.120
Please give me a chance to work for you.

02:12.200 --> 02:14.680
You're betraying your master for glory.

02:16.200 --> 02:17.720
Why should I trust you?

02:18.480 --> 02:20.320
I know one thing

02:21.760 --> 02:23.880
from 16 years ago.

02:26.880 --> 02:29.400
What's that?

02:29.480 --> 02:30.560
It was a long time ago.

02:31.160 --> 02:32.520
I can't remember.

02:34.640 --> 02:35.480
Black Dragon Bandits.

02:36.960 --> 02:41.800
Yan's Trading Convoy will arrive
at Piti Spring the day after tomorrow.

02:41.880 --> 02:43.400
Yan's Trading Convoy?

02:45.040 --> 02:46.880
It was a Yangzhou merchant

02:47.400 --> 02:50.280
who escorted Kang's tribute.

02:52.800 --> 02:54.880
It was a long time ago.

02:55.480 --> 02:58.680
It doesn't make any sense to mention it.

02:58.760 --> 02:59.760
Of course.

03:00.440 --> 03:02.880
No one brings it up
because it's not the right time.

03:02.960 --> 03:08.560
I'm worried that the Yangzhou Cui family
is doomed to ruin.

03:08.640 --> 03:11.960
When the time comes,
Yangzhou will be chaotic.

03:12.760 --> 03:16.320
I'd like to guard Yangzhou for you.

03:16.400 --> 03:18.000
After all, I'm the only one around you

03:18.080 --> 03:22.280
who is familiar with Yangzhou.

03:22.360 --> 03:25.840
You said you were Jinran's senior brother.

03:26.440 --> 03:27.440
Yes.

03:28.400 --> 03:30.440
Since you're Jinran's senior brother,

03:31.800 --> 03:33.160
we're on the same side.

03:36.960 --> 03:38.760
Thank you, Prince Ying.

03:40.000 --> 03:41.120
I'm serving the Imperial Court.

03:41.200 --> 03:42.280
It doesn't matter
what official position I have.

03:43.720 --> 03:46.880
You went straight to the Zheng family
as soon as you arrived in Yangzhou.

03:46.960 --> 03:48.000
You said they were involved in a case

03:48.080 --> 03:49.720
and murder.

03:49.800 --> 03:52.880
There must be a misunderstanding.

03:53.480 --> 03:55.920
I won't know until I look into it.

03:56.000 --> 03:57.920
We will look into it.

03:58.000 --> 03:59.480
Jinran,

03:59.560 --> 04:02.600
you are the Inspector of Huainandao.

04:02.680 --> 04:04.840
If you want to investigate a case
in my area,

04:04.920 --> 04:06.600
should you

04:06.680 --> 04:09.760
think about me,
the official of the Governor's Office?

04:10.720 --> 04:12.000
Nanying,

04:13.120 --> 04:15.000
do you want me to drop the investigation?

04:29.800 --> 04:31.800
It's bending the law.

04:31.880 --> 04:33.360
I won't ask you to do that.

04:34.720 --> 04:38.440
She's just a woman
who won the top beauty title this year.

04:38.520 --> 04:39.640
It's a love killing

04:39.720 --> 04:42.680
or a revenge killing.

04:42.760 --> 04:44.080
I think

04:44.160 --> 04:49.640
the Zheng family must be framed.

04:51.000 --> 04:52.440
You have a point.

04:53.440 --> 04:54.320
However,

04:55.560 --> 04:58.040
I came to Yangzhou by water.

04:59.200 --> 05:01.480
I found a batch
of the Black Dragon Bandits' robbed goods

05:02.000 --> 05:03.760
that they were selling to Yangzhou.

05:04.360 --> 05:05.640
I followed the goods

05:05.720 --> 05:07.040
to the house

05:07.120 --> 05:08.880
and discovered Lady Huan's death.

05:08.960 --> 05:10.920
It's different from what you think.

05:11.600 --> 05:13.200
It is not an ordinary love killing

05:13.840 --> 05:15.960
or a revenge killing.

05:17.040 --> 05:19.160
Hexi Black Dragon Bandits were involved.

05:19.720 --> 05:20.760
Nanying.

05:22.200 --> 05:24.680
I'm afraid you can't suppress it.

05:35.280 --> 05:37.720
LONG-LASTING BENEFITS
FOR FUTURE GENERATIONS

05:43.720 --> 05:45.280
There was a murder.

05:47.600 --> 05:50.280
From now on,

05:50.360 --> 05:52.680
no one in the Zheng family
is allowed to leave Yangzhou.

05:55.800 --> 05:57.720
Inspector Zhang. What about Zheng Wu?

06:00.200 --> 06:02.640
Although Zheng Wu is suspected,

06:02.720 --> 06:04.080
there's no further evidence.

06:04.600 --> 06:05.920
He doesn't have
to be imprisoned immediately.

06:07.160 --> 06:08.160
From tomorrow,

06:08.240 --> 06:10.640
he must check in
at the Governor's Office every day,

06:10.720 --> 06:12.480
in case we have questions for him.

06:12.560 --> 06:13.640
If we summon him,

06:13.720 --> 06:15.680
he must go to us immediately.

06:17.480 --> 06:18.320
Yes, sir.

06:18.400 --> 06:20.920
Inspector Zhang, since you gave the order,

06:21.000 --> 06:24.000
we will obey it.

06:27.520 --> 06:28.520
Careful.

06:29.960 --> 06:30.840
Mother.

06:31.440 --> 06:33.960
Instead of suffering at home,

06:34.040 --> 06:35.800
you should move here and enjoy the peace.

06:35.880 --> 06:36.960
At least,

06:37.040 --> 06:40.080
you don't have to see those nasty people.

06:46.360 --> 06:48.840
I don't need to see your aunt,
but I still have to see my niece.

06:51.760 --> 06:53.040
Shijiu.

06:53.120 --> 06:56.160
My mother will move in here for a while.

06:58.800 --> 07:00.680
Lady Yu.

07:00.760 --> 07:01.840
Save it.

07:01.920 --> 07:03.680
I can't even recognize you

07:03.760 --> 07:06.000
as the legitimate daughter
of the Cui family in that dress.

07:07.000 --> 07:08.960
I am the legitimate daughter
of the Cui family.

07:09.840 --> 07:11.480
But you're Wu's mother.

07:15.760 --> 07:18.040
You're nice to Wu.

07:18.120 --> 07:21.320
But someone wants to kill him.

07:24.000 --> 07:25.040
Tong.

07:26.160 --> 07:28.600
Go and settle the groom and the servants.

07:28.680 --> 07:29.720
Yes, ma'am.

07:30.720 --> 07:31.560
Lady Yu.

07:31.640 --> 07:33.440
It's windy here. Let's talk inside.

07:33.520 --> 07:34.880
Yeah, let's talk inside.

07:34.960 --> 07:35.840
Let's go, Mother.

07:35.920 --> 07:37.480
Go.

07:41.240 --> 07:42.600
That is to say,

07:43.680 --> 07:46.680
you weren't at the scene
of Lady Huan's death.

07:46.760 --> 07:48.080
But Lady Huan

07:48.160 --> 07:50.320
was holding half your sleeve.

07:50.400 --> 07:51.840
Someone framed him.

07:51.920 --> 07:53.200
And it was an insider.

07:55.520 --> 07:56.520
Who's the insider?

07:56.600 --> 07:59.080
The person who attracted two elders

07:59.160 --> 08:01.000
and set up the trap in the ancestral hall

08:01.080 --> 08:03.840
was Lady Huan's murderer, who set you up.

08:05.760 --> 08:07.120
If it was a premeditated murder,

08:07.200 --> 08:09.120
he took your sleeve

08:09.200 --> 08:10.680
to frame you.

08:11.480 --> 08:13.720
If it was manslaughter,

08:13.800 --> 08:15.480
it was even more suspicious

08:18.160 --> 08:19.400
that he carried your sleeve with him.

08:21.640 --> 08:24.200
Lady Shijiu, thank you.

08:28.640 --> 08:30.080
Zheng Si always saw me

08:30.160 --> 08:32.600
as a thorn in his side.

08:33.120 --> 08:35.480
If he hadn't framed me for the murder,

08:35.559 --> 08:37.320
he would have done it sooner or later.

08:37.400 --> 08:39.880
The important thing now
is to find evidence.

08:42.840 --> 08:43.919
Evidence…

09:10.360 --> 09:13.360
Lady Huan
never wore this kind of golden hairpin.

09:15.480 --> 09:17.360
Were you trying to tell me something?

09:25.600 --> 09:31.520
GUAN RIVER

09:41.840 --> 09:42.800
What are you doing here?

09:42.880 --> 09:44.640
Wake her up. I have something to ask her.

09:45.640 --> 09:46.480
What do you want?

09:47.080 --> 09:48.440
She was the only one
at the scene of the crime.

09:48.520 --> 09:50.520
How did you know
she was the only one there?

09:51.520 --> 09:52.680
I'll explain later.

09:52.760 --> 09:54.440
The important thing
is to find out the truth.

09:54.520 --> 09:55.800
Otherwise, you will take the fall.

09:56.600 --> 09:58.120
Not only will Clear Mind close,

09:58.200 --> 09:59.480
but you will also die.

10:00.080 --> 10:01.400
Duanwu.

10:02.240 --> 10:03.840
-Duanwu.
-Yunxiu.

10:03.920 --> 10:05.160
Why am I here?

10:05.240 --> 10:07.760
Didn't I go to Riverside Alley
to buy jewelry?

10:07.840 --> 10:09.320
Do you remember what you saw?

10:10.880 --> 10:11.720
Lady Huan?

10:19.520 --> 10:21.720
I went to the Riverside Alley
to buy jewelry.

10:21.800 --> 10:23.080
Sir.

10:23.160 --> 10:25.400
Where did you get so much jewelry?

10:25.480 --> 10:27.320
It's from the Western Regions.

10:28.160 --> 10:29.560
I mean,

10:29.640 --> 10:31.640
your supplier.

10:31.720 --> 10:34.200
Then, I heard someone shouting.

10:34.280 --> 10:35.520
I'm going to report you.

10:36.640 --> 10:37.880
Is that Lady Huan?

10:41.600 --> 10:44.080
It sounded like Lady Huan.

10:46.000 --> 10:48.600
I thought Lady Huan
also came to buy jewelry.

10:48.680 --> 10:49.920
What about the stolen goods?

10:51.160 --> 10:52.320
What stolen goods?

10:52.400 --> 10:53.720
Stolen goods?

10:55.480 --> 10:57.120
She's fine. I'll explain later.

10:57.200 --> 10:58.040
Come with me.

10:58.680 --> 11:00.120
What do you mean by stolen goods?

11:00.880 --> 11:02.560
-I'll explain later--
-Black Dragon Bandits' stolen goods?

11:03.560 --> 11:05.720
Why are the Black Dragon Bandits'
stolen goods in the Zheng family?

11:05.800 --> 11:06.840
I told you.

11:06.920 --> 11:07.960
I don't have time to explain.
Just come with me--

11:08.040 --> 11:09.720
Lady Huan is dead.

11:10.520 --> 11:11.960
Yan Zijing.

11:12.040 --> 11:14.520
Do you think about anything
other than revenge?

11:16.400 --> 11:18.320
If you don't want
Lady Huan to die in vain,

11:20.680 --> 11:21.680
come with me.

11:26.200 --> 11:29.120
ZHENG'S MANSION

11:37.960 --> 11:41.120
Si, you should work hard.

11:42.080 --> 11:44.560
After the Cui family was destroyed,

11:44.640 --> 11:47.080
your father has always pissed on me.

11:47.800 --> 11:50.440
If Zheng Wu gets favored by your father,

11:50.520 --> 11:53.720
We won't have a place in the Zheng family.

11:54.240 --> 11:56.000
You're a legitimate son.

11:56.080 --> 11:57.760
I know.

11:57.840 --> 11:59.160
As you know,

11:59.240 --> 12:00.840
my father never liked me.

12:00.920 --> 12:03.760
I don't have a chance to behave.

12:03.840 --> 12:08.000
You have a chance now.

12:09.200 --> 12:10.400
The Red Leaf Crown
that was going to be given

12:10.480 --> 12:11.520
to the Empress Dowager was ruined.

12:11.600 --> 12:13.600
Your father is anxious.

12:13.680 --> 12:16.600
Tell this to your father.

12:17.640 --> 12:20.120
Tell him
that you will deal with the things

12:20.200 --> 12:21.880
at home.

12:25.360 --> 12:26.320
Mother.

12:26.400 --> 12:28.360
Our family has such a secret.

12:28.440 --> 12:30.920
Your father is wary of me.

12:31.480 --> 12:33.040
But I know everything

12:33.120 --> 12:34.920
that happened in the Zheng family.

12:35.920 --> 12:37.640
However,

12:37.720 --> 12:40.400
this matter is too dangerous.

12:40.480 --> 12:43.040
You can't do it in person.

12:43.120 --> 12:45.040
You should find someone you can trust.

12:49.600 --> 12:50.560
Someone I can trust.

12:51.880 --> 12:53.920
Huan can be trusted.

12:54.560 --> 12:57.080
But I can't let her know the truth.

12:58.640 --> 12:59.760
Let go.

13:01.520 --> 13:02.640
Mr. Wu.

13:03.400 --> 13:05.040
You can't drink as much as I do.

13:05.720 --> 13:07.520
You drink the most.

13:14.480 --> 13:16.120
One, two, go.

13:17.360 --> 13:18.280
Go home.

13:18.800 --> 13:20.800
I found the person to do it.

13:20.880 --> 13:22.400
About the scapegoat,

13:24.280 --> 13:27.160
you're the right person, Wu.

13:43.120 --> 13:44.480
Mr. Si.

13:44.560 --> 13:45.840
The master wants to see you.

13:54.720 --> 13:57.200
Tell me. What happened?

14:00.400 --> 14:02.480
It's all my fault.

14:03.000 --> 14:04.480
I trusted Lady Huan

14:04.560 --> 14:06.000
and implicated Wu.

14:06.080 --> 14:07.280
Master. Zheng.

14:08.600 --> 14:10.200
I'm here

14:10.280 --> 14:11.880
to protect your Zheng family.

14:11.960 --> 14:14.520
If you don't tell me the truth,

14:14.600 --> 14:16.680
there's no need for me to stay.

14:17.320 --> 14:19.440
I'll explain to you later.

14:20.240 --> 14:22.440
You should explain it to Inspector Zhang.

14:23.440 --> 14:26.080
Who are Inspector Zhang's origins?

14:26.680 --> 14:30.160
He's from a famous family.
He's Prince Ying's sworn brother

14:30.760 --> 14:34.360
and the Emperor's pet.

14:36.280 --> 14:38.520
He's Prince Ying's sworn brother. Then…

14:39.280 --> 14:42.880
Why did he turn you down
and go after the Zheng family?

14:43.520 --> 14:48.080
Do you know why he refused
to be a Secretariat Drafter

14:48.160 --> 14:51.520
and volunteered
to be the Inspector of Huainandao?

14:53.960 --> 14:57.720
Because he found
the tribute pearls fraud in Guangzhou.

14:57.800 --> 15:01.880
And he found clues to Kang's tributes.

15:01.960 --> 15:03.960
Then, he traced it all the way to Hexi

15:04.040 --> 15:05.280
and found the Black Dragon Bandits.

15:05.360 --> 15:08.400
He came here

15:08.480 --> 15:10.320
to find those things.

15:10.400 --> 15:13.880
We are hanging by a thread.

15:13.960 --> 15:17.160
But you're not aware of it yet.

15:21.920 --> 15:23.240
Idiot.

15:23.320 --> 15:25.000
You're dragging the Zheng family down.

15:25.080 --> 15:26.160
Tell me the truth.

15:26.240 --> 15:28.000
I told the truth.

15:28.080 --> 15:29.120
Nonsense.

15:30.240 --> 15:32.520
I left that to you.

15:32.600 --> 15:35.040
How did Wu know that mansion?

15:35.120 --> 15:36.480
How did your second and third uncles

15:36.560 --> 15:38.240
find out so quickly

15:38.320 --> 15:40.080
and accuse Wu?

15:40.160 --> 15:42.840
Wu and Lady Huan
have long been in collusion.

15:42.920 --> 15:44.280
They invested in Clear Mind.

15:44.360 --> 15:45.800
Father, you know about it.

15:45.880 --> 15:47.240
Lady Huan is your lover.

15:47.320 --> 15:48.480
I knew it.

15:49.240 --> 15:51.080
I cut her off a long time ago.

15:51.160 --> 15:52.640
I didn't expect her

15:52.720 --> 15:55.160
to go to Wu after that.

15:56.000 --> 15:58.680
Now, she's dead.

15:58.760 --> 15:59.680
Which is great.

16:02.200 --> 16:04.640
Where were you at the time?

16:04.720 --> 16:06.680
I was with Steward Zheng.

16:06.760 --> 16:07.600
If you don't believe me,

16:07.680 --> 16:09.640
you can ask Steward Zheng.

16:10.560 --> 16:12.160
Idiots.

16:12.240 --> 16:13.440
You're both idiots.

16:13.520 --> 16:14.960
All right.

16:16.080 --> 16:17.680
They are not entirely to blame.

16:17.760 --> 16:19.360
There's one more person.

16:20.080 --> 16:20.920
Yan Zijing.

16:22.000 --> 16:23.080
Yan Zijing…

16:23.680 --> 16:27.560
Are you saying
that they didn't want to take it away?

16:27.640 --> 16:30.280
They wanted to ruin my big thing.

16:30.360 --> 16:32.840
Only the Zhenlang Pavilion

16:32.920 --> 16:35.280
has rubies in Yangzhou.

16:35.360 --> 16:37.040
Seventy million mace

16:37.120 --> 16:39.520
in three days. Cash on delivery.

16:40.560 --> 16:44.240
The Cui family was ruined by him.

16:45.320 --> 16:46.680
Su Muzhe

16:46.760 --> 16:48.920
used to be called Duanwu.

16:49.000 --> 16:51.160
She was from the Yan's Trading Convoy.

16:54.200 --> 16:56.080
But they don't seem to know each other.

16:56.800 --> 16:58.320
Are you sure?

16:59.400 --> 17:01.520
You better think about it.

17:02.400 --> 17:03.360
Mr. Xu.

17:03.440 --> 17:05.240
Mr. Xu. Mr. Xu.

17:06.079 --> 17:07.720
Mr. Xu. Mr. Xu…

17:16.400 --> 17:17.440
You…

17:28.720 --> 17:31.360
Think of a way
to go up and rub the footprint.

17:31.440 --> 17:32.280
Yes, sir.

17:34.000 --> 17:36.240
Are you done with the scene investigation?

17:36.320 --> 17:37.560
Yes.

17:37.640 --> 17:39.480
According to the scene,

17:39.560 --> 17:41.520
we suspect a man and a woman.

17:41.600 --> 17:42.840
They didn't enter through the gate.

17:43.960 --> 17:46.040
A man climbed over the wall
and entered the front yard.

17:46.120 --> 17:48.920
A man and a woman climbed
over the wall and left the backyard.

17:49.560 --> 17:51.080
According to the footprints on the scene,

17:51.160 --> 17:53.320
the man was carrying something.

17:53.400 --> 17:54.640
There should have been a third person.

17:54.720 --> 17:56.160
A third person?

17:58.680 --> 17:59.880
Someone in the alley

17:59.960 --> 18:01.600
saw two strange women and a strange man

18:01.680 --> 18:03.200
enter the mansion.

18:04.280 --> 18:06.360
Now that we know there are three suspects,

18:06.440 --> 18:09.040
we should draw their portraits

18:09.120 --> 18:10.480
and put out warrants.

18:11.280 --> 18:13.760
We don't know who the killer is.

18:13.840 --> 18:14.720
We can't jump to conclusions.

18:15.880 --> 18:18.320
Jinran, I hope you solve the case sooner.

18:18.400 --> 18:20.920
I have something to do. Excuse me.

18:26.760 --> 18:28.280
He's weird.

18:29.560 --> 18:31.040
The case of selling the stolen goods
turned into a homicide case.

18:31.120 --> 18:32.200
What do we do?

18:32.280 --> 18:33.800
We must catch the murderer.

18:35.440 --> 18:37.120
The three people you just found

18:37.200 --> 18:38.680
are important.

18:38.760 --> 18:41.000
We must find them first.

18:48.560 --> 18:50.080
I, Bai Niao,

18:50.160 --> 18:52.920
want to sue Su Muzhe,
the owner of Clear Mind,

18:53.000 --> 18:54.600
for murdering Lady Huan

18:54.680 --> 18:57.680
to get the jewelry she invested
in Clear Mind.

18:59.080 --> 19:02.320
Here's Lady Huan's blood letter.

19:09.360 --> 19:10.480
And I have a witness.

19:10.560 --> 19:12.120
She saw

19:12.200 --> 19:13.360
Su Muzhe lead someone

19:13.440 --> 19:14.840
into the mansion where Lady Huan died.

19:14.920 --> 19:15.760
SU MUZHE OF CLEAR MIND
PLOTTED MY FORTUNE AND TRIED TO KILL ME

19:18.960 --> 19:22.760
This is the Inspector of Huainandao.

19:22.840 --> 19:24.480
Inspector Zhang is in charge

19:24.560 --> 19:26.040
of the murder of Lady Huan,

19:26.120 --> 19:29.520
who won the top beauty title
at the Qionghua Festival.

19:30.320 --> 19:32.680
Inspector Zhang,
please punish the murderer severely

19:32.760 --> 19:34.360
and have justice for Lady Huan.

19:35.080 --> 19:36.200
Inspector Zhang.

19:36.760 --> 19:38.680
I'll leave it to you

19:39.280 --> 19:40.320
to find suspect Su Muzhe.

19:48.160 --> 19:49.200
It's my duty.

19:55.280 --> 19:57.840
CLEAR MIND

19:57.920 --> 19:59.920
Su Muzhe of Clear Mind.

20:00.000 --> 20:01.960
Come out and surrender.

20:06.240 --> 20:07.240
Lady Shiqi?

20:07.840 --> 20:09.040
Mr. Zhang?

20:09.120 --> 20:10.520
What are you doing here?

20:11.640 --> 20:12.520
Su Muzhe…

20:12.600 --> 20:14.160
She's Duanwu.

20:14.240 --> 20:15.920
Su Muzhe is Duanwu?

20:17.880 --> 20:18.920
How is that possible?

20:19.000 --> 20:20.200
Someone accused her of killing Lady Huan.

20:20.280 --> 20:22.520
Duanwu didn't kill Lady Huan.

20:22.600 --> 20:24.040
She must have been wronged.

20:24.120 --> 20:25.480
Duanwu wouldn't kill.

20:25.560 --> 20:28.040
-How do you know she was wronged?
-Yeah.

20:28.120 --> 20:29.720
Who knows if she's telling the truth?

20:29.800 --> 20:31.080
Nonsense.

20:33.120 --> 20:33.960
Silence!

20:35.000 --> 20:37.240
The government has a process
for handling cases.

20:37.320 --> 20:39.960
I'll enforce the law.

20:40.040 --> 20:41.440
Please calm down.

20:43.320 --> 20:44.280
Let's talk inside.

20:54.320 --> 20:55.760
What happened when you came back
from the desert?

20:56.720 --> 20:57.760
Why did Duanwu change her name?

20:57.840 --> 21:00.400
Since we came from the desert,
Duanwu has been a different person.

21:00.480 --> 21:02.400
I know she suffered a lot

21:02.480 --> 21:03.800
and went through a lot.

21:04.640 --> 21:05.960
If you hadn't been here today,

21:06.040 --> 21:08.240
I wouldn't have known
she was accused of killing.

21:08.320 --> 21:09.640
Mr. Zhang, please trust Duanwu.

21:09.720 --> 21:12.200
I'm sure Duanwu
wouldn't have done such a thing.

21:13.080 --> 21:14.920
But I have no proof that she's innocent.

21:15.000 --> 21:16.840
What happened between her and Lady Huan?

21:17.440 --> 21:19.480
We met Lady Huan at the Qionghua Festival.

21:20.400 --> 21:22.600
Duanwu and Lady Huan are like sisters.

21:23.200 --> 21:25.960
Duanwu is very sad
about Lady Huan's death.

21:32.840 --> 21:34.600
Zhang Jinran wouldn't have thought

21:34.680 --> 21:36.680
that his clues were pointing to you.

21:41.760 --> 21:43.000
Aren't you going to meet him?

21:43.080 --> 21:43.920
He'll help you.

21:44.000 --> 21:45.400
I didn't kill anyone.

21:47.040 --> 21:47.880
I don't need his help.

21:47.960 --> 21:49.600
Do you think anyone cares about the truth?

21:49.680 --> 21:51.120
I care about the truth.

21:53.080 --> 21:54.440
I'll go back and look for evidence.

21:54.520 --> 21:56.040
I'll look for evidence for you.

21:59.280 --> 22:00.520
Yan Zijing.

22:00.600 --> 22:03.040
It's all because of you.

22:03.600 --> 22:04.960
Lady Huan is dead.

22:05.040 --> 22:06.360
I got involved.

22:07.640 --> 22:09.080
Isn't that what you wanted?

22:09.160 --> 22:10.680
I didn't want to involve you in this.

22:10.760 --> 22:12.240
You didn't want to involve me in this.

22:12.320 --> 22:14.600
Okay. Let me ask you something.

22:14.680 --> 22:16.240
What is Mr. Zhang investigating?

22:17.040 --> 22:18.640
What do you know about Lady Huan's death?

22:18.720 --> 22:20.720
You should tell me

22:20.800 --> 22:22.840
what you see and what you know.

22:22.920 --> 22:24.640
You are wanted in Yangzhou.

22:24.720 --> 22:27.080
Only I can avenge you.

22:27.160 --> 22:29.280
Only I can prove that you're innocent.

22:31.960 --> 22:33.160
You're still doubting me.

22:33.800 --> 22:36.400
Proving your innocence
and avenging Lady Huan

22:36.480 --> 22:39.440
-don't conflict with my purpose.
-What if there's a conflict?

22:42.240 --> 22:43.400
What would you do?

22:52.320 --> 22:53.280
You told me

22:56.760 --> 22:58.240
that people could only believe
in themselves.

23:01.800 --> 23:03.760
If I hadn't gone to Riverside Alley,

23:03.840 --> 23:05.840
Duanwu wouldn't have been framed.

23:07.800 --> 23:09.600
All I did was get her in trouble.

23:10.120 --> 23:11.160
I couldn't help her.

23:11.880 --> 23:13.960
I knew what was going on.

23:15.160 --> 23:16.720
She was sued.

23:18.640 --> 23:20.200
I can't bend the law.

23:21.400 --> 23:22.760
I'll have to seal Clear Mind.

23:25.320 --> 23:26.520
And she'll be wanted.

23:28.320 --> 23:30.600
Mr. Zhang, please clear Duanwu's name.

23:32.000 --> 23:33.200
Don't worry.

23:36.520 --> 23:37.920
Let me ask you one more question.

23:38.760 --> 23:41.800
Where is Yan Zijing now?

23:45.160 --> 23:47.080
My target is the Zheng family.

23:47.160 --> 23:49.960
I won't allow the Zheng family
to frame you to get away with it.

23:52.240 --> 23:53.720
Tell me what happened.

23:57.960 --> 23:59.240
I'm the only one who can help you now.

24:10.920 --> 24:12.520
You might be able to find clues
in the homes with dogs

24:13.120 --> 24:14.600
in Riverside Alley

24:15.120 --> 24:16.520
or in places with wild dogs.

24:17.360 --> 24:19.160
Lady Huan was under surveillance
at the time.

24:20.440 --> 24:21.680
She wanted to hide something.

24:23.040 --> 24:24.160
She wouldn't have hidden the things
too far away.

24:24.240 --> 24:26.400
Okay, I'll ask Kang Ju to find it.

24:27.120 --> 24:28.160
Ask Mr. Zhang to do it.

24:28.840 --> 24:31.160
What Lady Huan hid
could be important evidence.

24:32.840 --> 24:34.400
Mr. Zhang is an official.

24:35.560 --> 24:36.720
It's only useful if he looks into it.

24:40.600 --> 24:41.960
Seal Clear Mind.

24:42.040 --> 24:43.040
CLEAR MIND

24:43.120 --> 24:44.880
Why did you seal Clear Mind?

24:50.720 --> 24:51.720
He's coming to you.

24:56.000 --> 24:56.840
Aren't you going to see him?

24:58.960 --> 25:00.080
You go.

25:01.560 --> 25:03.960
He's an imperial official.
You are a suspect.

25:04.920 --> 25:06.040
You don't see him

25:08.160 --> 25:09.080
because you're afraid
of getting him in trouble, right?

25:15.760 --> 25:18.520
My master is not here.
I've told you many times.

25:19.160 --> 25:20.240
Please leave.

25:22.680 --> 25:23.640
Kang Ju.

25:28.480 --> 25:29.400
Mr. Zhang.

25:30.200 --> 25:31.040
No.

25:32.480 --> 25:34.920
Inspector Zhang. Long time no see.

25:36.840 --> 25:38.560
You're promoted.

25:45.080 --> 25:46.120
Where is Duanwu?

25:46.760 --> 25:48.200
I don't know.

25:48.840 --> 25:50.920
I'm a stranger to her.

25:51.000 --> 25:52.640
What she does has nothing to do with me.

25:54.000 --> 25:55.760
What happened between you?

25:56.880 --> 25:58.200
That's between us.

25:59.120 --> 26:01.240
You've been through a lot together.

26:02.080 --> 26:03.720
Don't you care about her?

26:04.360 --> 26:06.920
I don't believe Duanwu could kill.

26:08.560 --> 26:10.600
I don't care what name she changed

26:11.200 --> 26:12.840
or what she went through.

26:13.800 --> 26:14.760
I'm telling you.

26:15.720 --> 26:18.640
In my mind, she's always Duanwu,
who's not afraid of anything.

26:36.360 --> 26:39.120
Find a chance and give this to him.

26:43.200 --> 26:46.200
ZHENLANG PAVILION

26:50.960 --> 26:54.000
YANGZHOU GOVERNOR'S OFFICE

27:35.840 --> 27:37.680
Zhang Jinran
found two boxes of stolen goods

27:37.760 --> 27:39.240
in a house.

27:41.920 --> 27:45.120
The Black Dragon Bandits' stolen goods
appeared in Yangzhou.

27:47.400 --> 27:48.360
The Zheng family
is selling the stolen goods

27:48.440 --> 27:49.640
of the Black Dragon Bandits.

27:50.240 --> 27:52.440
Mr. Zhang came here for that.

27:53.120 --> 27:54.680
The Zheng family was involved

27:55.880 --> 27:56.720
in the tribute case.

27:59.640 --> 28:01.040
The Zheng family.

28:06.840 --> 28:08.200
Lady Huan.

28:10.880 --> 28:12.840
Who is Lady Huan?

28:12.920 --> 28:14.360
Here's your letter.

28:14.440 --> 28:15.960
He doesn't love me anymore.

28:16.040 --> 28:17.960
FATHER SI

28:19.560 --> 28:20.600
Zheng Zhixing.

28:24.720 --> 28:25.960
Wait.

28:26.040 --> 28:27.200
I've got someone at Zheng's Mansion.

28:27.280 --> 28:29.880
As long as he comes out, we'll catch him.

28:29.960 --> 28:31.960
You can't go out, Duanwu.

28:32.040 --> 28:35.120
Bai Niao went to the Governor's Office
and accused you of killing Lady Huan.

28:35.200 --> 28:37.240
With Xu Nanying's help,

28:37.320 --> 28:40.360
the Zheng family will blame you
for all their crimes.

28:40.440 --> 28:42.200
What will you do
after you catch Zheng Zhixing?

28:44.240 --> 28:45.680
What about Lady Huan's innocence?

28:49.640 --> 28:50.480
I know what to do.

28:52.920 --> 28:53.960
Protect her.

28:59.840 --> 29:00.760
Who's that?

29:11.480 --> 29:12.960
Take me to Zheng Zhiheng.

29:13.880 --> 29:14.840
Now!

29:15.800 --> 29:17.360
Su Muzhe.

29:31.320 --> 29:33.520
Ms. Su, you're really a heroine.

29:33.600 --> 29:35.920
The government
is looking for you everywhere.

29:36.000 --> 29:37.680
But you came to me.

29:38.280 --> 29:39.960
You, the Zhengs,
sold the stolen goods and killed people.

29:40.560 --> 29:42.280
I am innocent.

29:42.360 --> 29:43.240
What do I have to worry about?

29:43.320 --> 29:45.760
Selling stolen goods and killing people
are serious crimes.

29:46.920 --> 29:49.640
Who in the Zheng family
are you talking about?

29:49.720 --> 29:51.080
Zheng Si.

29:51.760 --> 29:54.560
Si and I are brothers.

29:56.240 --> 29:57.920
Watch your mouth.

30:03.280 --> 30:04.840
If you are willing to help me,

30:07.440 --> 30:08.720
I have a way to get him to confess.

30:11.240 --> 30:14.560
Why should I help you against my brother?

30:14.640 --> 30:16.960
If your father, Mr. Zheng, doesn't want
to give up his legitimate son,

30:18.160 --> 30:19.720
who will take the fall?

30:22.200 --> 30:23.120
Helping me

30:24.920 --> 30:26.160
is helping yourself.

30:29.520 --> 30:31.240
Ms. Su, what did you get?

30:43.640 --> 30:44.600
Mr. Wu.

30:56.240 --> 30:57.960
-Wu.
-Si.

30:58.040 --> 30:59.560
Looks like you've been out
all night again.

31:00.360 --> 31:02.080
Inspector Zhang asked you to go

31:02.160 --> 31:03.680
to the Governor's Office
to check in every day.

31:03.760 --> 31:04.920
Did you go there?

31:05.000 --> 31:06.600
Of course I did.

31:06.680 --> 31:09.520
I went there. And I heard something.

31:11.200 --> 31:12.280
What's that?

31:14.640 --> 31:17.680
It is said that the Huan family is broke.

31:17.760 --> 31:20.920
They will sell all of Lady Huan's jewelry,

31:21.000 --> 31:22.160
collection of calligraphy and paintings,

31:22.240 --> 31:24.920
and even

31:25.000 --> 31:26.400
secret letters.

31:26.480 --> 31:28.080
Nowadays, in the city of Yangzhou,

31:28.160 --> 31:30.400
all the young men from noble families
who had dealings with her

31:30.480 --> 31:32.440
rushed to the Huan family.

31:32.520 --> 31:34.040
Is it funny?

31:35.800 --> 31:37.280
I'm going to take a nap.

31:44.040 --> 31:45.720
Lady Huan just died.

31:45.800 --> 31:46.960
Her family is selling her stuff.

31:47.040 --> 31:47.960
HUAN ZHEN'S MEMORIAL TABLET

31:48.680 --> 31:49.880
Lady Huan almost went
to the Qionghua Festival

31:49.960 --> 31:52.000
without jewelry.

31:52.080 --> 31:53.440
They're trying to cheat money.

31:53.520 --> 31:55.160
Yeah, you're right.

31:58.760 --> 32:00.040
Ladies and gentlemen,

32:00.120 --> 32:03.520
Lady Huan was noble and loyal.

32:04.200 --> 32:08.120
It's hard to accept that she died at 24.

32:08.200 --> 32:09.840
It's sad.

32:10.760 --> 32:12.920
Our auction today is not for money.

32:13.000 --> 32:15.560
We want the people of Yangzhou to gather

32:15.640 --> 32:17.720
to mourn her.

32:17.800 --> 32:20.280
This is the first item
to be auctioned today.

32:20.360 --> 32:22.720
It's a painting Lady Huan
painted for her lover.

32:22.800 --> 32:25.080
It's called
Appreciate the Beauty of Spring.

32:25.160 --> 32:27.280
-Lady Huan had a lover.
-I don't know.

32:27.360 --> 32:28.360
She never mentioned it.

32:28.440 --> 32:31.320
We don't know who her lover is.

32:31.400 --> 32:33.920
But she went through a lot

32:34.000 --> 32:35.560
and loved him deeply.

32:35.640 --> 32:37.320
Lady Huan's lover

32:37.400 --> 32:39.360
is from a famous family in Yangzhou.

32:40.040 --> 32:41.480
They fell in love with each other
at first sight.

32:41.560 --> 32:43.120
They once sailed on the river

32:43.200 --> 32:44.800
and played a song together.

32:45.320 --> 32:48.360
And they read and painted together.

32:49.000 --> 32:50.720
They privately decided to get married

32:50.800 --> 32:52.200
under the moon.

32:52.280 --> 32:55.160
It's a pity that she died,

32:55.240 --> 32:57.600
but he didn't come to mourn her.

32:57.680 --> 32:59.320
Appreciate the Beauty of Spring
becomes their love token.

32:59.400 --> 33:01.080
He's an unfaithful lover.

33:01.720 --> 33:03.840
-Who is he?
-Yeah, who is he?

33:03.920 --> 33:05.880
I have

33:05.960 --> 33:07.520
a poem here.

33:08.360 --> 33:10.560
"Zheng invited me to a village.

33:11.240 --> 33:13.840
Four mountains are fresh green.

33:13.920 --> 33:16.840
The peach garden is beautiful.

33:16.920 --> 33:19.720
Send peace and harmony to Zhen."

33:21.200 --> 33:23.160
The last word of this poem

33:23.240 --> 33:25.040
is Lady Huan's first name.

33:25.120 --> 33:27.960
But Zheng…

33:28.040 --> 33:31.320
Zheng? Is her lover a Zheng?

33:31.400 --> 33:32.440
-Zheng?
-Who is he?

33:32.520 --> 33:33.520
-Who?
-Zheng?

33:35.080 --> 33:36.720
I'll look at other poems.

33:37.560 --> 33:39.880
Show us.
Let's see who the unfaithful lover is.

33:39.960 --> 33:41.200
Yeah.

33:41.280 --> 33:42.200
Come on.

33:42.280 --> 33:43.240
Huan.

33:43.880 --> 33:44.720
Huan.

33:44.800 --> 33:46.320
HUAN ZHEN'S MEMORIAL TABLET

33:47.960 --> 33:49.840
I didn't expect you

33:51.120 --> 33:54.040
to leave me so easily.

33:54.120 --> 33:56.400
When I close my eyes,

33:58.680 --> 34:00.960
you are there.

34:01.040 --> 34:03.440
I want to die with you.

34:04.400 --> 34:06.360
I wanted to take the imperial examination,
become an official,

34:06.440 --> 34:08.480
and marry you.

34:09.480 --> 34:12.400
I wanted to tell the whole world
that you're my wife.

34:13.080 --> 34:13.960
I didn't expect you

34:15.800 --> 34:18.040
to die.

34:48.239 --> 34:50.040
I swear by my blood.

34:52.679 --> 34:54.400
If I'm unfaithful to you,

34:59.160 --> 35:01.600
I'll be struck by lightning.

35:02.320 --> 35:03.520
He swore.

35:12.920 --> 35:15.800
Suspect Su Muzhe showed up
at Lady Huan's residence.

35:15.880 --> 35:18.040
If she resists, kill her.

35:18.120 --> 35:19.160
Yes, sir.

35:23.280 --> 35:24.360
GOOD WEATHER FOR FARMING

35:24.440 --> 35:25.520
Ladies and gentlemen.

35:27.640 --> 35:29.320
This is not an auction.

35:32.040 --> 35:33.680
I'm not selling anything

35:35.120 --> 35:36.800
of Lady Huan's.

35:37.440 --> 35:39.960
I'll take care of her funeral.

35:40.720 --> 35:41.560
Ladies and gentlemen,

35:43.240 --> 35:45.400
please do me this kindness.

35:46.520 --> 35:47.720
Please leave.

35:51.040 --> 35:54.160
Thank you for coming to her memorial.

35:54.240 --> 35:55.280
Please leave.

35:59.000 --> 36:00.880
He's sincere.

36:11.640 --> 36:13.400
Thank you.

36:14.960 --> 36:15.920
Please leave.

36:41.120 --> 36:42.720
Lady Huan.

36:44.080 --> 36:46.960
You got me in such big trouble
after you died.

36:58.200 --> 36:59.600
Did you inform the government?

36:59.680 --> 37:01.440
Yes. They're outside.

37:04.000 --> 37:05.920
Who are you?

37:06.000 --> 37:07.120
What do you want to do?

37:08.280 --> 37:10.040
Lady Huan found

37:10.120 --> 37:11.680
something wrong with the jewelry
before she died.

37:13.560 --> 37:14.880
Then, she left me a message

37:15.760 --> 37:18.120
about your love for her.

37:20.040 --> 37:21.360
Why don't I read it to you?

37:22.480 --> 37:23.960
I have three regrets.

37:25.080 --> 37:28.000
First, I ran into the wrong man.

37:29.560 --> 37:31.360
Zheng Si is unfaithful.

37:33.520 --> 37:34.360
Second,

37:37.680 --> 37:39.160
I was tricked by him

37:40.640 --> 37:41.560
into selling his stolen goods.

37:44.120 --> 37:45.000
Third…

37:45.080 --> 37:46.200
Nonsense.

37:46.280 --> 37:48.120
Nonsense!

37:48.200 --> 37:49.560
What do you want to do?

37:54.280 --> 37:55.560
Zheng Si.

37:56.160 --> 37:58.320
I have no support in Yangzhou.

38:00.200 --> 38:01.920
If I get caught by the government,

38:04.720 --> 38:06.880
I, Su Muzhe,
want to take someone down with me.

38:07.480 --> 38:08.400
No.

38:09.280 --> 38:10.400
You are Su Muzhe?

38:11.240 --> 38:12.080
Yes.

38:14.160 --> 38:16.280
Lady Huan opened Clear Mind

38:17.600 --> 38:19.200
with me.

38:21.160 --> 38:23.600
I didn't expect Lady Huan
to end up like this.

38:27.600 --> 38:28.560
Why did you kill Lady Huan?

38:31.160 --> 38:33.760
Why did you kill Lady Huan?

38:33.840 --> 38:34.840
Say it!

38:36.320 --> 38:38.480
I'll tell you. I did everything.

38:38.560 --> 38:40.120
I didn't mean to kill her.

38:41.360 --> 38:42.800
She wanted to tell on me.

38:43.720 --> 38:45.640
She's just a songstress.

38:46.360 --> 38:47.640
Her life doesn't matter.

38:47.720 --> 38:48.840
It's not a big deal.

38:48.920 --> 38:50.520
The Huan family abandoned her.

38:50.600 --> 38:51.560
The Zheng family also abandoned her.

38:51.640 --> 38:53.280
No one cares about her death.

38:53.360 --> 38:54.320
You're different.

38:54.400 --> 38:55.840
Su Muzhe.

38:55.920 --> 38:57.640
You have Clear Mind.

38:58.920 --> 39:00.720
You have a bright future.

39:01.640 --> 39:03.160
Let me go.

39:03.240 --> 39:05.680
Let me go. I won't ask
the government to arrest you.

39:06.240 --> 39:07.160
You go your way.

39:07.800 --> 39:09.120
I go mine.

39:09.200 --> 39:10.240
What do you say?

39:17.160 --> 39:19.680
If I'm not going
to clear Lady Huan's name,

39:22.920 --> 39:26.400
I'll kill you right now
and sacrifice you to her.

39:27.000 --> 39:28.200
Ms. Su, thank you for not killing me.

39:28.280 --> 39:29.320
Thank you.

39:37.560 --> 39:40.000
Su Muzhe. You…

39:42.200 --> 39:43.280
Mr. Xu.

39:44.840 --> 39:45.800
Mr. Xu.

39:46.840 --> 39:48.080
Mr. Xu, help me.

39:48.160 --> 39:49.920
-Help me.
-Good-for-nothing. Get away.

39:51.360 --> 39:52.600
-Mr. Xu.
-Arrest him.

39:52.680 --> 39:54.200
Help me.

39:54.280 --> 39:55.480
Mr. Xu.

39:55.560 --> 39:57.080
Mr. Xu.

39:57.160 --> 39:58.400
Mr. Xu.

39:58.480 --> 39:59.560
Mr. Xu.

40:10.280 --> 40:13.120
Arrest Su Muzhe, too.

40:13.720 --> 40:14.960
Nanying.

40:15.040 --> 40:16.520
You heard it.

40:16.600 --> 40:18.240
Zheng Zhixing killed Lady Huan.

40:18.320 --> 40:20.680
Someone reported her.

40:20.760 --> 40:23.000
And she has Lady Huan's suicide note

40:23.080 --> 40:24.760
and the stolen jewelry.
Why shouldn't we arrest her?

40:25.560 --> 40:28.520
Jinran, do you want to bend the law?

40:28.600 --> 40:31.920
-Nanying, wait…
-Mr. Xu, Inspector Zhang.

40:32.960 --> 40:34.880
Just arrest me.

40:34.960 --> 40:36.120
I am innocent.

40:38.360 --> 40:41.200
Mr. Xu, Inspector Zhang,

40:43.120 --> 40:44.600
please clear Lady Huan and my names.

40:51.880 --> 40:53.120
Arrest Su Muzhe.

40:54.080 --> 40:55.320
I will interrogate her.

40:55.840 --> 40:56.760
Duanwu.

41:29.360 --> 41:31.800
Where is the suspect? Lead the way.

42:20.000 --> 42:21.160
Duanwu.

42:24.840 --> 42:26.680
I know why you were avoiding me.

42:29.200 --> 42:30.440
You didn't want to get me in trouble.

42:33.280 --> 42:34.640
But you and I…

42:41.680 --> 42:45.040
Inspector Zhang.
